<ContentLayout
  title="Metabolism Calculator — Calculate Your Resting Metabolic Rate"
  h1="Metabolism Calculator"
  description="Calculate your resting metabolic rate (RMR) and basal metabolic rate (BMR) using the Mifflin-St Jeor equation. Understand how your metabolism works and use it for weight goals."
  path="/guides/metabolism-calculator/"
  category="Guides"
